exists su name hwas tlat from filename "iwsp-embedding-query.bin" by ve num 80 0 as name float with ve num 20 be pfun myoc ya
exists su name pset gjat from filename "iwsp-embedding-table.bin" by ve num 240 0 as name float with ve num 3 20 be pfun myoc ya
exists su name lwat txik from filename "iwsp-embedding-index.bin" by ve num 2 0 as name number_ with ve num 1 be pfun myoc ya

from name pset gjat at name lwat txik to name lyac dlek be tsoc hsat do
ob name hwas tlat by name lyac dlek be kl6m psas do
